  "label": "Hateful",
  "description": "The meme uses a racial slur metaphor to associate Blackness with criminality, perpetuating a harmful and hateful stereotype. The text 'that chicken was so black the police just arrested it' directly maps the color black to Black people and implies inherent criminality, which is a well-documented form of anti-Black racism. The visual of Gordon Ramsay's angry expression is leveraged to amplify the absurdity of the stereotype, making the mapping between the text and his portrayal central to the meme's hateful intent.",
